# 1.5.16: Tom, a grey cat (a lynx point tabby), comes by the header a while after the start; sitting, he gives a tip
# on the page you are on, and a screen reader hears it ("Tom says:"); the start screen has him on the name
wait 1500
shot start.png
wait 3000
tap GLO
listen
wait 19000
wait 9000
said Tom says
shot tom.png
# 1.5.19: a knob turned and let rest, Tom says what it does and what its value means (voice 1's Role to Loops)
tap ENV
wait 300
spin K2 1
wait 1500
said Role: what this voice plays
wait 4000
said Loops: four tape loops
shot tom_knob.png
